OL,5,G0000 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FA forehead lump isn't what it
OL,7,     Fseems for Dr Magnus. Dr Emma
OL,8,     Fassists - or rather de-cysts - an
OL,9,     F80-year-old patient wanting to
OL,10,     Flook her best for her grandson's
OL,11,     Fwedding.
OL,12,G0100 Cold Case Killers
OL,13,     FIn 1997, Michael Menson was found
OL,14,     Fengulfed in flames in London.
OL,15,     FCould Superintendent Kevin Davis
OL,16,     Ffind the truth? Did Michael take
OL,17,     Fhis own life or was he the victim
OL,18,     Fof a horrific attack?
